    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "wkh4kms",
      "content": "The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) is the central bank of India. It was established on 1 April 1935 under the RBI Act, 1934."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "ydukh2l",
      "content": "It was nationalised on 1 January 1949."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "l80ea4h",
      "content": "Headquarters: Mumbai<br></br>First Governor: Sir Osborne Smith<br></br>RBI represents India in IMF and World Bank."
    },
    {
