    {
      "id": "a9v7elu",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "5. MONETARY POLICY COMMITTEE (MPC)"
    },
    {
      "type": "pullQuote",
      "content": "RRB ECONOMICS – CHAPTER 4: RESERVE BANK OF INDIA (ULTRA-DETAILED)",
      "id": "a0cvem3"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "ad9ctym",
      "content": "MPC was formed in 2016 under RBI Act amendment. It has 6 members and decides policy repo rate."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "4giyvcr",
      "content": "Objective: Maintain inflation target (4% ± 2%)."
    },
    {
      "id": "pxp3zxy",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "6. CREDIT CONTROL MEASURES"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "z8xvx51",
      "content": "Quantitative Methods:<br></br>• Repo Rate<br></br>• CRR<br></br>• SLR<br></br>• Open Market Operations"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "y23xrz8",
      "content": "Qualitative Methods:<br></br>• Moral suasion<br></br>• Selective credit control<br></br>• Rationing of credit"
    },
    {
      "id": "v09amrw",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "7.INFLATION TARGETING FRAMEWORK"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "4zkqauo",
      "content": "India adopted Flexible Inflation Targeting (FIT) in 2016 through amendment to RBI Act, 1934."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "f4ewauc",
      "content": "Target: 4% CPI inflation with tolerance band of ±2% (i.e., 2% to 6%)."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "h8f5iy4",
      "content": "The Monetary Policy Committee (MPC) is responsible for maintaining this target."
    },
    {
      "id": "xj8l1ye",
      "type": "table",
      "rows": [
        {
          "isHeader": true,
