    },
    {
      "id": "vqkv768",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "12. RBI & DIGITAL PAYMENTS ROLE"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "xk9p1d0",
      "content": "RBI promotes digital payment systems to ensure financial inclusion and reduce cash dependency."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "pwde0mv",
      "content": "Key Systems: UPI, NEFT, RTGS, IMPS."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "gaikct6",
      "content": "RBI established NPCI to manage retail digital payment systems."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "4vpo0yu",
      "content": "Digital payments improve transparency, reduce black money, and enhance efficiency."
    },
    {
      "id": "3lmebuw",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "13. RRB IMPORTANT ONE-LINERS"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "tz25ofc",
      "content": "• RBI established in 1935<br></br>• Nationalised in 1949<br></br>• Headquarter – Mumbai<br></br>• Repo Rate &gt; Reverse Repo Rate<br></br>• MPC decides policy rate<br></br>"
    }
  ],
